# cyto genome exported from cell 3 — load it via Load Genome (rename to cyto-brush.gene).
Break bb : Biomass < 4000 : Convert bb @15
Light : 0 < 1984 : FormBond b b
Break bb : ab < a & ab < 4000 & aa < 4220 : FormBond a a @15
Break aa : a < aa & a < 4000 : FormBond a b @15
Break ab : aa < ab & aa < 4800 : Contract @6
